.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-mr-show 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-mr\-show \- Show one merge request, its commits and conversation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm mr show\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-R\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-offline\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIMR\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one merge request, its commits and conversation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-R\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR
A repo ID or link; by default the swarm remote of this clone
.TP
\fB\-\-offline\fR
Use what is already here instead of syncing first
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIMR\fR]
Its branch or ID (default: the current branch)
